sis or a commercial bet?</td><td class=3D"n">=C3=972</td><td class=3D"n">10=
</td></tr>
        <tr><td><strong>Ease</strong></td><td>Given the real stack, how che=
ap is the change?</td><td class=3D"n">=C3=973</td><td class=3D"n">15</td></=
tr>
        <tr><td colspan=3D"3"><strong>Priority score</strong></td><td class=
