      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
  <div class=3D"panel">
    <span class=3D"eyebrow">One guardrail</span>
    <p><strong style=3D"color:var(--ink)">A high score never means "restyle=
 it."</strong> Where Gap is 0 or 1, the app already looks as good as it is,=
 and a high total means the opposite =E2=80=94 harvest it, or leave it alon=
e. World Mythologies scores 36 and the correct action is to touch nothing. =
The score ranks <em>where design attention belongs</em>, and the Work colum=
n says what that attention actually is.</p>
  </div>
</section>

