      <p>The only app on this list whose design cost is zero, because nothi=
ng exists yet. It is also the one with an audience you do not control =E2=
=80=94 BU colleagues, and eventually a vendor-neutral product story.</p>
      <ol class=3D"steps">
        <li>Write into CogniBase's <span class=3D"mono">CLAUDE.md</span> no=
w, before the first UI commit: <em>not Gradio; FastAPI serving a static fro=
nt end that imports <span class=3D"mono">qi-tokens.css</span>.</em></li>
        <li>Same rule for any new QI project from today onward. This is the=
 cheapest decision in the entire document and the only one that stops the p=
roblem recurring.</li>
