      <p>Rated higher than its single-user peers for one reason: it is ente=
rprise schema intelligence for SQL Server, Oracle, Postgres and OnBase, and=
 the "Beyond-MapSnap" charters treat it as product pre-work. If any QI tool=
 ends up in front of a BU colleague or a vendor, this is it.</p>
