t is a bare card on a flat field. It should carry the product's one-line pr=
omise ("your database blueprint") and nothing else new.</li>
        <li>The schema browser is a graph problem, so it inherits every Gra=
phPlex fix for free =E2=80=94 do it after the Plex work, not before, and re=
use the same renderer.</li>
